OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Irish police say they have made the
OL,6, largest and most significant arms find
OL,7, for more than a year.
OL,9,FTwo large oil drums containing guns,
OL,10,Fexplosives and ammunition were found
OL,11,Fburied on the beach between Malin and
OL,12,FMalin Head in County Donegal.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FOne drum contained 90 Kalashnikov
OL,15,Frifles, machine-guns, a large quantity
OL,16,Fof commercial explosives and 6,000
OL,17,Frounds of ammunition. The second tank
OL,18,Fis now being examined.
OL,20,FPolice are questioning a man under the
OL,21,FRepublic's anti-terrorist laws.
OL,23,T]CFrom 28-01-88 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
