CT,8,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F181A1769608925
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The TUC is planning a major rally in
OL,6, support of nurses' complaints about pay
OL,7, and the funding of the NHS.
OL,9,FThe health services committee of the
OL,10,FTUC - made up of officials of about a
OL,11,Fdozen unions - took the decision at a
OL,12,Fmeeting in London.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FThe rally will be held on March 5,
OL,15,Fshortly before the Budget on March 15.
OL,17,S/FNurses at about 15 London hospitals
OL,18,Fhave voted to strike and voting is
OL,19,Ftaking place at about 20 more. There
OL,20,Fare also ballots in Birmingham, Leeds,
OL,21,FSheffield and Cornwall.
OL,23,T]CFrom 28-01-88 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
