OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Irish Prime Minister Charles Haughey
OL,6, has condemned the Government's failure
OL,7, to prosecute RUC members involved in an
OL,8, inquiry into a "shoot to kill" policy.
OL,10,FHe attacked Attorney General Sir
OL,11,FPatrick Mayhew's statement on Monday
OL,12,Fthat there would be no prosecutions
OL,13,Fafter the Stalker-Sampson inquiry.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FSir Patrick said there had been
OL,16,Fattempts to pervert the course of
OL,17,Fjustice but prosecutions would not be
OL,18,Fin the national interest.
OL,20,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Tom King has
OL,21,Ftold MPs disciplinary action may still
OL,22,Fbe considered against RUC members.
OL,23,                      D]CFrom 28-01-88
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
